{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_vrdant_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_vrdant_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"小草的呼喊","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_vrdant_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7ac81c9e52dc71c7709b344e74177d153916aa8a00605897aa5eba34f3908e89","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，有什么需要的就直接说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直阴着脸站在店门前，客人都不敢来了，我生意不好做啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我给你介绍介绍这些新上的鲜花吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说说看，你是想送给妈妈，还是想送给女同学？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到您贴了招聘启事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是来应聘店员的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您需要的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是感染者吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我没法聘用你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系。拒绝我的，并不是只有您一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么想做这份工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我喜欢植物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也喜欢植物，因为它们懂得如何扬长避短。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然它们不会说话、不能行动，却会用娇艳的花朵与沁人的香气来讨人喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多植物并不会开花，也没有香味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，它们也值得人们去喜爱吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有意思，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是想起一个差事，或许很适合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必和太多人打交道，只需要和花草树木混在一起。不过，得经常去一些危险的地方就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识一个供货商，他在招募植物猎人——简单来说，就是找人帮他去搜集珍奇植物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"园艺店老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不要去试试看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦哦哦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手&镇静的打手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"绳网陷阱？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我们？我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们是游客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我们是游客！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我们听人说，这座荒废庄园的风景很好，所以才想来转转！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"真的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有什么东西在碰我，好凉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我也感觉到了......这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"藤蔓？！怎么会动啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近不止一拨人盯上了这个庄园，你们最好如实告诉我，你们是来这里做什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你们也会像之前那些人一样，成为这些食人植物的养料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"别和他废话了！告诉他吧！这该死的藤蔓好像缠住了我的脖子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们是来找“褐刺花”的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？“褐刺花”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这庄园里连一个花骨朵都找不见，怎么会有什么“褐刺花”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"这里真的有！就在那座雕像底下，千真万确！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"“褐刺花”不是花，是那种植物的根！只要把它的根挖出来，你就知道为什么大家叫它“褐刺花”了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来就是那些杂草......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"他是不是去找“褐刺花”了？难道他也是植物猎人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"*维多利亚粗口*，这藤蔓一扯就断开了，根本勒不死人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......他吓唬我？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“褐刺花”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种植物的根，真像一朵褐色的带刺的花啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇主说最近它的价格在黑市上炒得火热......因为有很高的药用价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不会开花，也没有香味。就因为它的根能治病，人们便需要它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至还用“花”来命名一种不会开花的植物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"维荻正要捡起掉落在田地上的“褐刺花”，却注意到一旁有一株孑然生长的小草。\n它很普通。但在这片麦田里，它又显得那么格格不入。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风吹来，那些未成熟的麦子识相地向一边倒去。\n这一瞬，小草终于让太阳看见了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"维荻看见了小草，也注意到了捡起那株名贵的“褐刺花”的自己的那只手。\n要不是有风吹来，他可能根本不会注意到那株小草。\n他忽然感到有些莫名的惭愧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哪个村来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（警觉）什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事......你鬼鬼祟祟地蹲在我的地里，反倒来问我什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还瞪我，快从我的地里滚开，别挡着我除草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除草？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"听到这个词，维荻下意识地看了一眼被他挡在身后的那株无名的小草。\n他知道这样做很怪很讨人嫌，但他还是开口了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这臭小子——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"维荻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"一脸惊喜的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，真的是你......维荻，我们有多久没见了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"一脸惊喜的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"还有沃森伯伯，镰刀可不能扬这么高，多吓人啊......噢，你们在吵架？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克，你认识他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"认识，何止认识！我们可是同学！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......曾经是同学。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你和以前没两样啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"沃森伯伯，怎么动这么大的气......说不定有什么误会呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同学......维荻他就是看上去有点凶，也不太会和生人讲话。其实，他没恶意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，或许你能给他讲明白，让他知道他不仅碍事，还很没礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，快点吧，快把他从我的地里带走吧！要是再跟他多吵两句，晚上我都要没精力和我家那老婆子拌嘴了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"进来吧，随便坐。我家里人都不在，不用拘束。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才知道这个村子是你的家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这可不是我想听的，半分钟前我还以为你是特意来找我玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"不过也对。谁会在探望老同学的路上，为了田地里的一株杂草差点和农夫打起来啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚才多谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"道谢就客气了......当然，要是你愿意帮我搞定我的假期野外实践报告，我会很高兴的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝，我可不想再......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，就知道你肯定会拒绝我，是开玩笑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你硬要把它保下来，是气昏头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"结果你还真把这杂草有模有样地栽种在样本盒里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克，我不认为它是杂草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这不是稗子或者什么别的野草......算了，我这个专业课不及格的就不和你这个前三名选手争了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是说它不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？你怎么愣住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它虽然有点像稗子，但又不完全一样，我才注意到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看这，像不像会长出和大尾草一样的圆锥花序？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的茎秆还有点像莎草......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"那，它是个未被发现过的新物种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我没见过，我也不记得有在书上见过相关的记载。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新物种？......或许存在这种可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"真怪，你都没搞清楚它到底是什么，就要和拿着镰刀的农夫干一仗？这可不像你会做的事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道为什么......当时只想着要保下它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你做对了，万一它真的是新物种呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，果然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我想要找你帮忙弄实践报告的原因！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是这么不起眼的一株小草，你也能注意到它的不同之处，这就是我和高材生的差别吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我也差点忽视它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"植物猎人并不需要这样没有经济价值的物种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"那又怎样？重要的是你足够敏锐，是你发现了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有个想法。要想知道它是不是新物种，那就去植物研究所之类的机构鉴定一下嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴定？好吧......不过在那之前，我还有些工作要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得回据点一趟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我拿到“褐刺花”了。已完成完整植株的采集，并连同其生长的土壤样本一起保存好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竞争对手？我好像是遇见了两个......不，他们没有妨碍到我，不如说正相反......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别的有经济价值的植物？......我没遇到，没什么特别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数据与照片已经传输给您了，如果没有问题，我明天就会返回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说，还有新的委托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我可以先回去，我们当面确认任务目标之后，过段时间我再重新出发呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您说这个任务很紧急，也......不，我不是在质疑您的判断，也不是不信任您，我只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我拿到新的目标植物，我就返程，可以吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，没法直接去植物研究所了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"你的雇主......我听他一开口就知道是个难缠的人。你就不能直接回去，告诉他没找到他要的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非我不需要这份工作了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，那就没办法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"和那些在实验室里冲洗试管、给样本瓶贴标签的工作比起来，植物猎人可酷多了吧！换我，我也不会放弃这么有趣的差事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，我不用你帮我弄什么野外实践报告了！就带我去做一回植物猎人吧！求你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"依照周密的计划潜入，骗过所有人的眼睛，还会随机应变躲过每一处危险，在“最终的房间”夺走目标......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"你看了蓝卡坞上个月公映的那部冒险片吗？就是在萨尔贡雨林里寻宝被土著追杀的那个？感觉没什么两样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没看过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"想来也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克，你知道我对那些不感兴趣......我也不是因为喜欢冒险才做植物猎人的工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要它，只是因为我需要收入，也想要继续和植物打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染了矿石病以后，这可能是我碰上的最好的选择了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啦，维荻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，因为矿石病就让你退学，是学校的损失。他们损失了一名真正热爱植物的年轻学者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"要是教授他知道你为了继续研究植物在做那么危险的事，他肯定会后悔当初没为你向学校求情的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......我该怪他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克，我们以前培育那些不起眼的实验样本，是怎么做的来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这不是还很熟练吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说着，维荻为栽培着“褐刺花”的温箱合上了盖子，打开了那个更小却更温暖的样本盒。\n他用手指感受样本盒中土壤的湿度，随后，又用喷壶往玻璃盒壁上喷了些水。\n无名的小草没有发出声响，但他知道小草在生长。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，维荻，照顾这些植物的时候，你真像变了一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是因为我从不担心会被它们厌弃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"厌弃？也许吧......可你也知道，这些植物并非时刻都能如我们所愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"就像以前我们一起在温室里培育实验样本的时候，长得不好的，早早死掉的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......更别说还有一些样本直到开花结果时，我们才会发现，它们其实并不是我们想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"也许没必要那么期待......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"期待？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你担心要是最后证实了它就是随处可见的普通野草，我会失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会失望。因为我不是为了这种虚无缥缈的可能性，才去照料它的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克，如果你在干农活的时候，看到它长在作物边，你会怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是把它除掉啊。就算留下来当肥料，也有点勉强吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很长一段时间里，我也是这么认为的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那时的我，以为自己是人人需要的作物，从未想过有一天自己会无处可去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至还不如供养作物的肥料......它们好歹还能一起待在田地里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"维荻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，图克。就算如此，我也活得挺好不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想清楚了，我并没有多期待它是一个新物种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是觉得......它也该有一隅之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仔细想来，它要的其实并不多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"土壤，水，还有阳光......足够了，足够它继续倔强地生长了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"维荻忽然有一种开口去问无名小草的冲动——\n你叫什么名字？\n你渴望被人关注吗？\n你......你也害怕被人厌弃吗？\n小草啊。\n......比起这小小的样本盒，其实你更希望回到那片广阔的田野里吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“......走吧，你快走吧。”\n“从我们这里滚开！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你也看到了，这是学校董事会统一决定的。”\n“比起在这里学习知识，还是身体健康更重要吧？”\n“......对，它们并不矛盾，但我们也要为其他的学生和教职工考虑呀。”\n“别想了，学校不可能单独给你一个人分一间宿舍。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n好吧，那我离开就是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"narration","text":"“大学生？我们不需要什么大学生，只要你会招徕客人......你是感染者？这可不行啊。”\n“我们不收感染者打字员。你说你可以在家办公？绝不会耽误工作？不要想了！”\n“喂，小子，离我的店远一点！别再让我看见你，隔离区才是你该待的地方！”\n“很抱歉，我没法聘用你。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n好吧，那我离开就是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"“这么多草鞋和草帽，一件都没有卖出去？”\n“问了，我都问了！没有采购商愿意收！啧......现在就连村长都躲着我们家。”\n“或许我们还可以去移动城市问一问......”\n“对，没错，这倒是个办法。我明天就去集市，把老太太留下的那几匹上好的棉布拿去，或许能换来个二手的摊车！”\n“把我的银手镯也拿去吧！总会有办法的......我们要留下他，再怎么样，他也是我们的孩子......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n或许，我还是离开更好吧。就算再也回不到过去了，我也要活得更像样子些。\n可......我又能到哪儿去呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嗯？\n......吵死了。\n我知道了，我会走，你们不用再赶我了！离了你们我也能活！\n“维荻——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我知道了！吵死了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是梦吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小草它......还在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？这里，似乎冒出了新的叶芽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得有些植物在感受到生存环境发生剧烈变化时，会更奋力地生长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小草啊......这个样本盒会让你觉得安全吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，维荻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开门啊！你这家伙不会还在睡吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克？你为什么会来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，为，什，么，会，来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托，你昨天不是答应了，要带我体验一下做植物猎人的感觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是玩笑啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"快点走吧，多我一个肯定能让任务更顺利的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"这样也能更早去植物研究所鉴定了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还惦记着这事啊......虽然鉴定一下也没所谓就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，好吧，那就一起来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，像你这样随随便便把泥脚印留在经过的地方，我不觉得我的任务会更顺利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哟吼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，这两个屋檐的距离，我跳得够远——唔唔唔噢噢妈妈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，好险。还好掉下去的是一片瓦，而不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你拉住我，维荻......？怎么是“稻草人”啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和你不一样，我会好好从下面爬上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不必向“稻草人”道谢，它大概是怕你把全村的人都喊来，然后看你在屋顶上表演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真不错啊，你果然还和在学校里一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明明都提早一步走入社会了，就不能对朋友宽容一点？真不成熟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧时间吧，图克。从那个烟囱跳进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪？烟囱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，我们不是要敲门进去吗？......等等等等，“稻草人”为什么在推我啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一阵寂静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这......“稻草人”接住我了，算是安稳落地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我可是很克制地没有喊出声来哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我也来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——你听没听到？我感觉我的心脏跳得好快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"就在刚刚，我竟然跟着植物猎人去了“最终的房间”，还真的拿到了“古代的神秘作物种子”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是从一间无人住的乡村小屋里拿走任务目标罢了......哪有那么夸张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，好像没有我想象的刺激啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么没有探秘的过程呢？进去，拿到了，然后离开......就完事了？也太轻松了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这个种子，也不是什么珍奇的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，估计是上一个接线人放在这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"接线人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并不是每个任务都需要植物猎人深入险境，也会有这种去指定地点取个东西的简单工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......那不就是信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说最初的植物猎人，就是一批专门为跨国香料商人工作的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"这样听来，一点也不酷了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，回据点吧。我要向雇主汇报，他最好别再给我安排新的任务了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"图克，经过那片泥地时，我提醒过你要把鞋底清理干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我照做了啊。你看，干净得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这边的鞋印是......怎么和据点附近的那么像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什么意思？你怎么突然就跑了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快，来不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"narration","text":"远远地，维荻看见据点的方向升起了浓烟。\n他用尽全部的力气冲刺，烟味越来越刺鼻，让他有些喘不上气。\n原先的隐隐不安，已经成为面前燃起的火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊喜的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，你看他身上带着的......竟然还有意外收获！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊喜的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是一袋方形葵的种子，得值不少钱吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，闭上嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"切断据点里的应急通讯器，把有用的都拿上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他恢复意识之前，快走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"妈妈，我们的田里长了很多小草。要把它们除掉吗？\n“对，它们会妨碍到作物生长。”\n那我们可以让它们离作物远一点？比如，把它们移栽到后院的园子里？\n我想知道它们长大后的样子。\n“嗯......好主意。”\n“它们也许会长成麦子，也许会长成粟米。”\n“听说在很久以前，那些粮食和它们没什么两样。”\n......要是它们不能吃呢？\n要是它们开不出好看的花，还变得臭臭的，那就太糟糕了！\n“哈哈，我的孩子已经会因为这种事感到困扰啦？不用担心——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“它们也会有属于自己的价值的。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"维荻！刚刚跑过去的那两个人，是不是抱着“褐刺花”的温箱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......你受伤了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"要去追他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看，小草......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"小、小草？......喂，你该不会要去据点里吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"图克","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"别——火势越来越大了，别冲进去，维荻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那株小草......我还没有带它去植物研究所......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没有为它起名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算无人在意它，但它依然顽强地活在田野里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不应该被随意除去，也不该葬身火海......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不应该被驱赶，也不该被忘记......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是想活下去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了......我的样本盒，它还在这......他们没把你夺走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不起眼，也是你的优点吧......"},{"type":"narration","text":"维荻用手抹去附在玻璃盒壁上的黑灰，焦急地确认小草的安危。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维荻","speakerId":"avg_4107_vrdant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......那株小草？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在火光中，样本盒中的景象维荻看得很清楚。\n据点里骤然升起的高温显然让他的小草不太好受——\n像稗子的叶片发蔫了，像莎草的茎秆也弯折了，但那像大尾草的部分，竟然正在“绽放”。\n那是它的花吗？维荻不确定。是这场大火才让它变样的吗？维荻也不确定。\n没有人能在第一次看到那些新长出来的细细的须时，就笃定这是一种植物的花朵。\n看它那蔫掉的叶子和那弯掉的茎秆，这恐怕也很难称得上是一次“盛放”。\n但维荻能够确定的是，它不是稗子也不是莎草，它不是任何一种他曾知晓的野草。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
